r_sin10k_100u: a resistor alone (no state, no LTE), type="sine" sinedc=0 ampl=1 freq=10k, step=100u stop=1m, no maxstep
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model rm sp_resistor
model vsource vsource
v1 (1 0) vsource type="sine" sinedc=0 ampl=1 freq=10k
r1 (1 0) rm r=1k
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis tran1 tran step=100u stop=1m
endc
